  "notes": "GPIO table, ADC/touch channels, strapping, flash and UART0 pins: ESP32 and WROOM-32 datasheets and the DevKitC V4 user guide (GPIO 37/38 are not broken out). gpioMaxInputV is VIH max = VDD + 0.3 V; the ESP32 is not 5 V tolerant. Current: typical 130 mA is an estimate blending Wi-Fi RX (95-100 mA) and TX (240 mA at 50% duty) plus the USB bridge; peak 500 mA is Espressif's recommended supply current. 3V3 budget: the AMS1117 is rated 1 A, minus the 500 mA the module may draw. 5V pin range is not published: 4.75-5.5 V is an estimate (the LDO needs about 1.3 V headroom, and the input capacitor is rated 10 V). Mass is an estimate (not published). Current boards ship with the WROOM-32E module, which is the same for this purpose."
